 new mandates. Such strictures could eventually influence how the entire **country** approaches substance abuse policy in the future.\n\nP.P.S This summary reflects the significant shift in Oregon's legal landscape regarding drug possession.", "logprobs": [{"token": "Oregon", "logprob": -1.192093e-07}, {"token": "'s", "logprob": -0.00055298593}, {"token": " pioneering", "logprob": -0.027743729}, {"token": " effort", "logprob": -0.43176535}, {"token": " to", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " dec", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "riminal", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "ize", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " drug", "logprob": -0.039406788}, {"token": " possession", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " ends", "logprob": -0.17172278}, {"token": " this", "logprob": -5.4836423e-06}, {"token": " Sunday", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.1109808}, {"token": " replaced", "logprob": -8.3446537e-07}, {"token": " by", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " legislation", "logprob": -0.00095442764}, {"token": " that", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " reinst", "logprob": -0.049687844}, {"token": "ates", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " criminal", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " penalties", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " for", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " holding", "logprob": -1.4305125e-06}, {"token": " small", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " quantities", "logprob": -4.5419773e-05}, {"token": " of", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " hard", "logprob": -0.0080684805}, {"token": " substances", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": ".", "logprob": -0.00079019286}, {"token": " Under", "logprob": -0.00079019286}, {"token": " the", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " new", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " statute", "logprob": -0.0002317101}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.0013184294}, {"token": " individuals", "logprob": -0.15503664}, {"token": " found", "logprob": -0.15502849}, {"token": " with", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " drugs", "logprob": -2.3259223}, {"token": " like", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " f", "logprob": -0.0032932088}, {"token": "entany